### Editors / IDEs ###
# RustRover / JetBrains
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file. For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

### OS cruft ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### blacktape_brain's SQLite store (real ingested personal data) ###
# <export_dir>/.blacktape/store.db (see brain/src/blacktape_brain/cli.py's
# DEFAULT_DB_SUBPATH) -- catches it if an export dir ever ends up inside or
# near this repo.
**/.blacktape/

### Real personal-data export samples (never commit) ###
# Real Snapchat/Google Takeout exports used to sanity-check the bt-parse-*
# parsers -- and anything derived from running the parsers/brain on them --
# contain real personal data (GPS history, chat logs, friends lists) and
# must never be committed.
#
# Convention: drop real export directories/files under a top-level samples/
# folder (anywhere in the tree) when sanity-checking locally.
samples/

# Safety net: also ignore by the actual export file/folder names these
# exports use, in case a sample ends up somewhere other than samples/ --
# these mirror the same filename patterns the parsers' source-system
# detection heuristics key off of (see parsers/common/src/lib.rs and
# parsers/bt-parse-gps/src/main.rs).
**/*takeout*
**/*Takeout*
**/mydata*
**/*location_history*
**/*Location History*
**/*semantic_location_history*
**/*Semantic Location History*
**/*memories_history*
**/*Memories History*
**/*chat_history*
**/*Chat History*
**/*timeline_edits*
**/*Timeline Edits*
**/*timelineEdits*

# Derived output from running the parsers/brain against real samples.
*.result.json

### Project-local scratch output ###
result.json
